AmbireRecoveryActionDeclarationsTest
├── when asked for the policy action interface
│   └── it should return true
├── when asked for the recovery action interface
│   └── it should return true
├── when asked for the ambire recovery action interface
│   └── it should return true
├── when the recovery action interface id is computed
│   └── it should equal 0x4ca82439
├── when the ambire recovery action interface id is computed
│   └── it should equal 0xdb7b0011
├── when asked for erc165
│   └── it should return true
├── when asked for the invalid interface id
│   └── it should return false
├── when asked for any other interface
│   └── it should return false
├── when asked for the interface ids from before the split
│   └── it should return false
├── when the name is read
│   └── it should answer AmbireRecoveryAction
└── when the version is read
    └── it should answer 1.0.0
